# ENARA LO experiment: frozen learning outcomes (from ENARA curriculum success criteria) and a
# held-out assessment bank. Never sent to the tutor or the simulated learner's tutoring context.
# Each stage has 2 items; items are equivalent in difficulty but differ in wording and context.
# Transfer items change subject, vocabulary and situation; retention items are new parallel forms.
def I(p, *acc): return {'prompt': p, 'accepted': list(acc)}
